    "The source-integrity streaming change preserves the original digest/count/max arithmetic and one-statement snapshot; reviewed local equivalence, single-hash and cleanup/lifecycle regressions are recorded separately.",
    "The consolidation verifier binds exact release, policy, roles, route/core-check counts and cleanup authority; subset success alone cannot assert full acceptance.",
    "Historical pending/failure evidence remains unchanged. The legacy Tracker receipt is archived byte-for-byte from the parent revision; current evidence points to immutable release receipts.",
    "Actual customer screenshots, raw logs, private artifacts, credentials, dependencies, generated build output and temporary files remain excluded."
